{
  "name": "freshness-boundaries",
  "description": "Nine single-role companies whose only snapshot is 0, 7, 7d23:59:59, 8, 59, 59d23:59:59, 60, 61 and 400 days before as_of. Freshness is 1000 for d<=7 (7d23:59:59 floors to 7), rhu(1000*(60-d),53) in between (d=8 -> 981, d=59 -> 19) and 0 at d>=60: the formula itself is continuous at 7 and 60, so d=61 and d=400 are there to catch an implementation that applies it (negative!) or forgets the clamp. The first three tie on score, as do the last three; ties are ordered by key.",
